          <span class="system-swatch system-swatch-accent">Bronze</span>
          <span class="system-swatch system-swatch-paper">Paper</span>
        </div>
        <div class="system-content">
          <p class="case-meta">DESIGN + CODE EXPLORATION</p>
          <h3>A small design system, built with AI assistance</h3>
          <p>Using this portfolio as a working playground: turning design decisions into reusable color tokens, spacing rules, button states, and responsive layouts with Codex.</p>
          <details class="system-details">
            <summary>Explore the foundations</summary>
            <dl class="system-foundations">
              <div><dt>Color tokens</dt><dd>Neutral text and surfaces, a bronze accent, and sage/blue category colors for supply- and demand-side work.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Spacing + controls</dt><dd>Shared spacing tokens and primary/secondary buttons with hover, pressed, focus, and disabled states.</dd></div>
              <div><dt>Responsive rules</dt><dd>Media queries at 900px and 640px adjust columns, spacing, and navigation. Reduced-motion preferences are respected.</dd></div>
            </dl>
          </details>
        </div>
